  "summary": "Senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore of the Nick Xenophon Team (NXT) announced her resignation from the Senate after discovering she holds dual British citizenship by descent through her mother, who was born in Singapore (a former British colony) and became a British citizen in 1983. Kakoschke-Moore, born in Darwin in 1985, had previously believed she was not a British citizen based on childhood advice. She expressed shock upon learning the truth and plans to refer the matter to the high court to determine her Senate seat's replacement. NXT leader Nick Xenophon called the situation 'devastated' but noted it may not end her political career, citing unclear legal precedents after a recent high court ruling. A potential recount of the 2016 Senate election could favor NXT candidate Tim Storrer."
}
